"`EF_AMDGPU_FEATURE_SRAMECC_UNSUPPORTED_V4` (zero) because they do not "
"support mode selection. Their SRAMECC behavior is implied by "
"`EF_AMDGPU_MACH`; a zero SRAMECC field does not mean SRAMECC is disabled on "
"these processors."
